  "description": "You may encounter rough weather while pulling the cargo, so this epithelial truck tonneau which covers the back of the pickup truck will provide total cargo protection. When you pass a bumpy road, it helps to keep cargo inside the truck and prevents items dropping from your vehicle while delivering. The truck tonneau cover will shield your cargo from the heavy rain and strong wind when you are pulling the cargo. This is no doubt an item safety enforcer for you.\nFitment\nfor ‎2005-2026 Nissan Frontier 5ft\nFeatures\nCompatibility: Compatible with 5'' bed of 2005-2026 Nissan Frontier(NOT FOR México); Custom-fit solution to increase truck bed utility\nElement-Proof Cargo Cover: Crafted with high-quality FRP sheet, our truck bed tonneau cover offers excellent scratch resistance and protection against different weather elements including rain, snow, dirt, and UV rays. Enjoy reliable durability without fading, cracking, or peeling\nNo-drill Installation: Install the hard tri-fold tonneau cover in no time without any drilling or modifications needed; Comes with detailed instructions for added convenience; Note that if your truck has cargo racks, remove them before installing this cover\nAll-around Strength: Non-slip FRP sheet works with PP honeycomb structure to achieve bearing capacity up to 450 pounds; Embedded clamps and reinforced latches prevent accidental opening during driving for increased safety; Includes LED light to facilitate item retrieval in dim or dark conditions\nEasy Folding and Warning: Gain flexible bed access by single, dual, or tri-folding the cover and securing with nylon straps; Please be sure to install the tonneau cover as specified by the instructions, and tighten all the bolts before driving; Never drive with the cover partially open",
